# Files nobody edits by hand (TOOL-5). check-protected refuses edits Claude makes to them
# with its edit tools; shell commands are not checked. GitHub folds the diffs of those
# marked linguist-*. The command that owns each one still rewrites it. A family kind's
# mirror, configs/<group>/<kind>.yaml, is marked by its `# Generated by` line. The answers
# file stays unfolded: a pull request that changes `_src_path` changes which template the
# next update runs.
configs/defaults/** linguist-generated protected=generated
.copier-answers.yml protected=generated
notebooks/reference/** linguist-vendored protected=published
